  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How to deallocate a receipt\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 20 Jul, 2021 at  4:42 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nContacts >> Customers >> Go into customers account >> Find the invoice that the receipt has been allocated to >> Use the drop down box to select 'Unallocated amount'.\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to deallocate a receipt \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nFrom the navigation panel, go into 'Contacts' and then 'Customers'. \n\nUsing the search function, find the customer and go into their account. \n\nFind the invoice that the receipt has been allocated to and using the action drop down box, click on 'Unallocated Amount' \n\nMethod 2:\n\nYou can choose to delete the receipt if need be. \n\nGo into 'Sales' and then 'Receipts' from the navigation panel \n\nFind the receipt and and using the action drop down box, click on 'delete'.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to deallocate a receipt\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 20 Jul, 2021 at  4:42 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Location:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Contacts &gt;&gt; Customers &gt;&gt; Go into customers account &gt;&gt; Find the invoice that the receipt has been allocated to &gt;&gt; Use the drop down box to select 'Unallocated amount'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Video Tutorial:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/a30e499f250046439d8a6795c3982cae\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to deallocate a receipt&nbsp;</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">From the navigation panel, go into 'Contacts' and then 'Customers'.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Using the search function, find the customer and go into their account.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134868541/original/h8sJIFDJejQuD0fXX7O4QKEKWNdlp8qu-g.png?1626687272\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134868541\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Find the invoice that the receipt has been allocated to and using the action drop down box, click on 'Unallocated Amount'&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134868936/original/gTHTxsIinMnNTTsqvntJv1miQdTDemnLkw.png?1626687740\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134868936\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u>Method 2:</u></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can choose to delete the receipt if need be.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Go into 'Sales' and then 'Receipts' from the navigation panel&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134869694/original/UpUBXMivJD3tC8PlV9_p6F0y-rgj9OZ_Zg.png?1626688470\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134869694\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Find the receipt and and using the action drop down box, click on 'delete'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134869831/original/2N9eAjQ6-azFEh0XBOiXS_tDRTh2FQgBzQ.png?1626688623\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134869831\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204574\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204574/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\